{"Title":"An Act clarifying the application of judicial retirement law","BillNumber":"H3978","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J23","Name":"Joint Committee on Public Service","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23","ResponseDate":"2023-07-10T12:25:35.343"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T14:19:49.6733333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3978/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 65D of chapter 32 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the word “offices” in line 72 the following words:- “regardless of whether his service in judicial office or offices was continuous.”\r\n\tSECTION 2. Said section 65D of chapter 32 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2016 Official Edition, is hereby further amended by striking out, in line 104, the word “shall” and inserting in place thereof the following word:- “may.”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Redraft","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable with Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H34","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H4082","Branch":"Senate","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4082/Branches/Senate/Amendments/1/"},{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H3978","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3978/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}